{"Mutating input parameter by sorting in place may cause unexpected side effects": 0.6493141651153564, "The validation logic for `age` and `timestamp` fields is incorrect - both validators check `self.initial_data` which runs before individual field validation, causing incorrect validation failures. When DRF validates fields, each validator runs independently, so checking for the other field in `initial_data` won't work as expected. The validators should run at the serializer level using `validate()` method instead.": 0.3639698028564453}